{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/231", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Describe a typical weekday in your life\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI start every morning by waking up around 7:30 AM, and then I usually have breakfast and read the news for a little while before heading off to work around 9:00 AM. At work, I spend my time doing various research and writing tasks for my company, and I usually work until around 5:30 PM. After work, I often like to exercise, cook dinner, or spend time with friends, and I usually go to bed around 11:00 PM.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nScientists have developed an exciting new technology called TEMPTACULAR. This technology allows you to change the temperature of something using just spoken commands. Come up with as many new, high quality, creative ideas as you can for new products using TEMPTACULAR.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nHere are a few possible ideas for new products using the TEMPTACULAR technology:\\n \\n\\n -A smartphone app that lets you adjust the temperature of your coffee or tea with spoken commands\\n -A smart oven that lets you adjust the temperature using spoken commands\\n -A smart air conditioner that lets you adjust the temperature using spoken commands\\n -A smart fridge that lets you adjust the temperature using spoken commands\\n -A smart watch that lets you adjust the temperature of your coffee or tea with spoken commands\\n -A smart thermometer that lets you adjust the temperature of your cooking with spoken commands\\n<extra_id_1>User\\ncan you come up with ideas that are more creative than these\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some more creative ideas for new products using the TEMPTACULAR technology:\\n \\n\\n -A smart thermostat that lets you adjust the temperature of your home with spoken commands\\n -A smart humidifier that lets you adjust the humidity of your home with spoken commands\\n -A smart air purifier that lets you adjust the air quality of your home with spoken commands\\n -A smart lightbulb that lets you adjust the brightness of your home with spoken commands\\n -A smart speaker that lets you adjust the volume of your music with spoken commands\\n -A smart toothbrush that lets you adjust the brushing intensity with spoken commands\\n -A smart hair dryer that lets you adjust the temperature of your hair with spoken commands\\n -A smart hair straightener that lets you adjust the temperature of your hair with spoken commands\\n -A smart curling iron that lets you adjust the temperature of your hair with spoken commands\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/932", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Please be the referee of a 1on1 cyberpunk red session with me set in 2020 night city\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, I’m happy to be the referee for a cyberpunk red session. What would you like the session to be about?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nplease be my dungeon master for a quick dnd game\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m happy to be your dungeon master for a quick Dungeons & Dragons game. What would you like the game to be about?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nnevermind\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m sorry, I was trying to make sure that I understood what you wanted. Would you like me to be the dungeon master for a different game?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nplease be the dungeonmaster for a cyberpunk red game for me\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nI’m happy to be the dungeon master for a cyberpunk red game. Could you tell me about the characters that you’d like to play?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nI'm playing a rank 5 fixer named Shamby and I want to play a game set in 2020 night city\", \"response\": \"Sure, I'd be happy to be the dungeon master for a cyberpunk red game set in 2020 Night City. Here are some ideas for your game:\\n \\n\\n 1. The players are all fixers working for different factions in Night City, each with their own agenda and missions. You, as Shamby, could be a key player in the underworld, with connections to various criminal organizations and a strong reputation as a fixer.\\n 2. The players could be a group of hacktivists who use their skills toorf to infiltrate corporate networks, expose corruption, and fight for the rights of the people. With the rise of technology and the increasing influence of megacorporations, the hacktivist movement is a key part of the cyberpunk world.\\n 3. The players could be involved in a street race Across the sprawling metropolis of Night City, with high stakes and dangerous competition. The players will need to use their skills and resources to navigate the dangerous and unpredictable world of street racing, while also dealing with the threat of rivals and the deadly dangers of the road.\\n 4. The players could be part of a mercenary team hired by various factions to carry out dangerous missions, such as extracting valuable data from corporate servers, protecting high-ranking targets, or taking down rival gangs. The players will need to navigate the complex web of alliances and rivalries that make up the criminal underworld of Night City, while also dealing with the physical dangers of their missions.\\n 5. The players could be part of a small team of illegal hackers who use their skills to attack various corporate and government targets. With the rise of technolgy and the increasing surveillance of the population, the players will need to be careful to avoid detection while also using their skills to fight against the oppression of the megacorporations.\\n \\n\\n These are just a few ideas for your cyberpunk red game set in 2020 Night City. The possibilities are endless, and you can tailor the game to fit your specific interests and play style.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/131", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"can i feed you a pdf file and ask questions about it\", \"response\": \"Yes, you can feed me a PDF file and ask questions about it. However, the extent to which I can answer questions about the contents of the PDF file depends on the information available in the file and my ability to process and understand the information.\\n\\nIf you want to ask questions about a specific PDF file, you can try uploading the file to a third-party service such as SmallPDF (https://smallpdf.com/) or Adobe Acrobat (https://acrobat.adobe.com/) to extract the text from the file. Once you have the text, you can copy and paste it into a chat window and ask questions about it.\\n\\nAlternatively, you can try using a natural language processing (NLP) tool such as OpenAI's GPT-3 (https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/gpt-3-api-reference) or Google Cloud Natural Language (https://cloud.google.com/natural-language) to extract information from the PDF file and answer questions about it.\\n\\nPlease note that both NLP tools and PDF processing tools may have limitations in their accuracy and ability to understand the context of the information in the file, so it's always a good idea to double-check the answers provided.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/740", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Can you grow new Dragron Tree plants from cutting?\", \"response\": \"Yes, you can grow new Dragon Tree plants from cuttings. Dragon Trees are easy to propagate by cuttings, which can be taken from the main stem or from the tips of branches. Here's how to do it:\\n\\n1. Choose a healthy section of the stem or branch to take the cutting from. Make sure it has at least one node (the place where leaves or branches grow from) and a few leaves.\\n\\n2. Cut the stem or branch with a sharp, clean knife or pruning shears. Make the cut just below a node, leaving a few leaves on the cutting.\\n\\n3. Remove the lower leaves from the cutting, leaving only the top leaves.\\n\\n4. Dip the cut end of the cutting in rooting hormone to promote root growth.\\n\\n5. Plant the cutting in a small pot filled with a well-draining potting mix.\\n\\n6. Water the cutting well and place it in a warm, bright location but out of direct sunlight.\\n\\n7. Keep the soil moist but not soggy, and wait for roots to form. This can take several weeks.\\n\\n8. Once the cutting has rooted, you can transplant it to a larger pot or into the garden.\\n\\nWith proper care, your new Dragon Tree plant should grow and thrive.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/37", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Act as a Alexa developer advocate and software engineer writing a conference talk proposal. I will give you a topic and information you can use to write a talk.\\n\\nWrite an talk proposal about how to build Alexa Widgets using the Alexa Presentation Language (APL). The audience is android and web developers that want to reach new customers on the Echo Show 15 device. Because on the Echo Show 15 you can customize the home screen with widgets to create a tailored home screen experience. For developer this allow their apps to surface tangible information for users when they need it.\", \"response\": \"Sure, here's a sample talk proposal for \\\"Building Alexa Widgets with APL for the Echo Show 15\\\":\\n\\nTitle: Building Alexa Widgets with APL for the Echo Show 15\\n\\nDescription:\\nIn this talk, we'll explore how to build widgets for the Echo Show 15 using the Alexa Presentation Language (APL). We'll cover the basics of APL and how it can be used to create visually engaging and interactive widgets that can be customized to surface relevant information for users. We'll also discuss the benefits of using APL for widget development, including its ease of use, cross-platform compatibility, and the ability to reach a wider audience of Echo Show 15 users.\\n\\nOutline:\\n\\nWhat is APL and how does it work?\\n\\nAPL syntax and best practices for widget development\\n\\nExamples of APL widgets and how they can be used\\n\\nHow to publish and manage APL widgets on the Echo Show 15\\n\\nQ&A session\\n\\nTarget Audience:\\n\\nThis talk is geared towards Android and web developers who are interested in expanding their skills to include APL widget development for the Echo Show 15. Attendees should have a basic understanding of Android or web development and be eager to learn how to create visually engaging and interactive widgets for the Echo Show 15.\\n\\nLearning Outcomes:\\n\\nBy the end of this talk, attendees will have a solid understanding of what APL is and how it can be used to build widgets for the Echo Show 15. They will also have a clear understanding of the benefits of using APL for widget development and will be able to create their own APL widgets for the Echo Show 15.\\n\\nReferences:\\n\\n[1] Alexa Presentation Language (APL) documentation: https://developer.amazon.com/docs/alexa-presentation-language/what-is-apl.html\\n[2] Building widgets for the Echo Show 15: https://developer.amazon.com/docs/device-apis/echo-show-widgets.html\\n[3] APL examples and tutorials: https://developer.amazon.com/docs/alexa-presentation-language/examples-and-tutorials.html\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/435", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"can I adjust the widgets layout in the wp-admin\", \"response\": \"Yes, you can adjust the layout of widgets in the WordPress admin area. Here's how:\\n\\n1. Go to the \\\"Appearance\\\" menu in the WordPress admin area and select \\\"Widgets.\\\"\\n2. Drag and drop the widgets you want to use into the widget areas you want to use them in.\\n3. Use the \\\"Save\\\" button to save your changes.\\n\\nYou can also adjust the size of the widget areas and the width of the widgets themselves.\\n\\nKeep in mind that the layout of widgets will depend on the theme you are using and the available widget areas. Some themes may have more or less flexibility in terms of widget layout than others.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/74", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"how to get help finding subsidized housing for someone in recovery in seattle\\n\", \"response\": \"There are several resources available in Seattle to help individuals in recovery find subsidized housing. Here are a few options:\\n\\n1. Housing Development Center (HDC): HDC is a nonprofit organization that provides affordable housing opportunities to low-income individuals and families in the Seattle area. They offer a range of housing options, including apartments, townhouses, and single-family homes. To qualify for their services, individuals must meet certain income requirements and be willing to participate in their housing stability program.\\n\\n2. Low Income Housing Institute (LIHI): LIHI is a nonprofit organization that provides affordable housing and support services to low-income individuals and families in the Seattle area. They offer a range of housing options, including apartments, townhouses, and single-family homes. To qualify for their services, individuals must meet certain income requirements and be willing to participate in their housing stability program.\\n\\n3. Homeward Trust: Homeward Trust is a nonprofit organization that provides housing and support services to homeless individuals and families in the Seattle area. They offer a range of housing options, including apartments, townhouses, and single-family homes. To qualify for their services, individuals must meet certain income requirements and be willing to participate in their housing stability program.\\n\\n4. King County Housing Authority: The King County Housing Authority provides housing assistance to low-income individuals and families in the Seattle area. They offer a range of housing options, including apartments, townhouses, and single-family homes. To qualify for their services, individuals must meet certain income requirements and be willing to participate in their housing stability program.\\n\\n5. Seattle Housing Authority: The Seattle Housing Authority provides housing assistance to low-income individuals and families in the Seattle area. They offer a range of housing options, including apartments, townhouses, and single-family homes. To qualify for their services, individuals must meet certain income requirements and be willing to participate in their housing stability program.\\n\\nThese are just a few options available to help individuals in recovery find subsidized housing in Seattle. It's always a good idea to reach out to multiple resources to increase the chances of finding available housing.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/287", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Give me 10 different, unique and convincing value propositions with a maximum of 144 characters for this website transloadservicesusa.com The target audience are truck drivers interested in reworking pallets and warehousing.\\n \\n\\n Please write in English language.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\n1. \\\"Save time and money with our fast, efficient loading and unloading services.\\\"\\n 2. \\\"We take the stress out of transport with our safe, reliable trucking services.\\\"\\n 3. \\\"Our top-notch customer service will keep you coming back for more.\\\"\\n 4. \\\"We provide quality service at competitive prices.\\\"\\n 5. \\\"Experience the difference with our personalized service.\\\"\\n 6. \\\"We offer safe, reliable service you can count on.\\\"\\n 7. \\\"Transload Services USA: The safe, reliable choice for your transport needs.\\\"\\n 8. \\\"Efficient, safe and reliable transport services.\\\"\\n 9. \\\"We offer the highest quality transport services at competitive prices.\\\"\\n 10. \\\"Get the service you need, when you need it, from Transload Services USA.\\\"\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCan you write these again in the voice of John Carlton?\\n \\n\\n Please write in English language.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\n1. \\\"If you need fast, efficient loading and unloading services, Transload Services USA is the company for you.\\\"\\n 2. \\\"Transload Services USA is the safe, reliable choice for all your trucking needs.\\\"\\n 3. \\\"We take pride in providing top-notch customer service.\\\"\\n 4. \\\"You can count on Transload Services USA for quality service at competitive prices.\\\"\\n 5. \\\"Experience the difference with our personalized service.\\\"\\n 6. \\\"With Transload Services USA, you know you're getting safe, reliable service you can count on.\\\"\\n 7. \\\"We offer the highest quality transport services at competitive prices.\\\"\\n 8. \\\"Efficient, safe and reliable transport services from Transload Services USA.\\\"\\n 9. \\\"Transload Services USA: The safe, reliable choice for your transport needs.\\\"\\n 10. \\\"If you need the service you need, when you need it, from a company you can trust, Transload Services USA is the company for you.\\\"\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCan you write these again in the voice of John Carlton targeting drayage services?\\n \\n\\n \\n\\n Please write in English language.\", \"response\": \"1. \\\"If you need fast, efficient loading and unloading services, Transload Services USA is the company for you.\\\"\\n 2. \\\"Transload Services USA is the safe, reliable choice for all your trucking needs.\\\"\\n 3. \\\"We take pride in providing top-notch customer service.\\\"\\n 4. \\\"You can count on Transload Services USA for quality service at competitive prices.\\\"\\n 5. \\\"Experience the difference with our personalized service.\\\"\\n 6. \\\"With Transload Services USA, you know you're getting safe, reliable service you can count on.\\\"\\n 7. \\\"We offer the highest quality transport services at competitive prices.\\\"\\n 8. \\\"Efficient, safe and reliable transport services from Transload Services USA.\\\"\\n 9. \\\"Transload Services USA: The safe, reliable choice for your transport needs.\\\"\\n 10. \\\"If you need the service you need, when you need it, from a company you can trust, Transload Services USA is the company for you.\\\"\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/34", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write a blog text for my companies website about a praline scanning demo we made. \\nWe first use a reference to white-balance the image and automatically adapt the camera parameters to optimize the image quality. Then used foreground-background segmentation where contour areas are used as robust filters. then these foreground segments are used to compute 17 hand-crafted features. Using machine-learning  (descision tree) we can now segment the selected pralines into their respective cathegories.\\n\", \"response\": \"Here is a blog post about the praline scanning demo you made:\\n\\nTitle: \\\"Praline Scanning: Revolutionizing the Way You Enjoy Your Sweets\\\"\\n\\nIntroduction:\\n\\nWe are excited to announce our latest innovation in the food industry - praline scanning! Our cutting-edge technology allows you to scan your favorite pralines and get detailed information about their ingredients, nutritional value, and more.\\n\\nHow it Works:\\n\\nOur praline scanning process begins with a reference image that is used to white-balance the image and automatically adapt the camera parameters to optimize the image quality. This ensures that the colors in the image are accurate and that the details of the praline are clearly visible.\\n\\nNext, we use foreground-background segmentation to segment the praline into its respective categories. Our robust filters use contour areas as a way to segment the foreground from the background, providing accurate and reliable results.\\n\\nOnce the praline has been segmented, we use 17 hand-crafted features to further classify it into its respective categories. These features include things like shape, size, and texture, allowing us to accurately identify the type of praline.\\n\\nTo classify the pralines, we use machine learning and a decision tree algorithm. This algorithm is able to quickly and accurately identify the type of praline based on the features identified in the previous step.\\n\\nBenefits of Praline Scanning:\\n\\nThere are many benefits to using praline scanning technology, including:\\n\\nImproved Accuracy: With praline scanning, you can be sure that the information about your pralines is accurate and up-to-date. Our technology is able to identify even the smallest details about each praline, ensuring that you have the most accurate information possible.\\n\\nConvenience: Praline scanning is a quick and easy process that can be done in just a few seconds. Simply scan your praline and our technology will provide you with all the information you need, allowing you to enjoy your sweets without any hassle.\\n\\nHealthier Choices: With praline scanning, you can make healthier choices when it comes to your sweets. Our technology allows you to see the nutritional information for each praline, allowing you to make informed decisions about what you eat.\\n\\nIncreased Transparency: Praline scanning provides increased transparency in the food industry. By providing detailed information about each praline, we are able to give consumers the information they need to make informed decisions about the food they eat.\\n\\nConclusion:\\n\\nPraline scanning is a revolutionary technology that is changing the way we enjoy our sweets. With its accuracy, convenience, and ability to provide healthier choices, praline scanning is a game-changer in the food industry. We are proud to be at the forefront of this technology and to be able to provide our customers with the best possible experience when it comes to enjoying their favorite treats.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/689", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"write a play where tamil and sanskrit argue themselves on superiority\\n\", \"response\": \"Title: A Cultural Debate\\n\\nCharacters:\\n\\n* Tamil (T)\\n* Sanskrit (S)\\n\\nSetting:\\nA stage with a podium for each character. The setting is neutral, allowing the audience to focus on the debate.\\n\\n(Lights up on the stage, the two characters enter and take their positions.)\\n\\nModerator: (Offstage) Ladies and Gentlemen, welcome to our cultural debate, where we will explore the question of superiority between two ancient and revered languages: Tamil and Sanskrit. Each language will be represented by a knowledgeable proponent. First, let me introduce Tamil, the language of the Tamils, a Dravidian language spoken predominantly in South India and Sri Lanka. Tamil, please introduce yourself.\\n\\nTamil: Greetings, everyone. I am Tamil, a language with a rich history and an independent existence. I am proud of my ancient origins and a continuous literary tradition dating back more than 2000 years. I am also the only classical language that has survived all the way to the modern era.\\n\\nModerator: Thank you, Tamil. And now, I would like to introduce Sanskrit, an ancient Indo-Aryan language that has had a profound impact on Indian culture and civilization. Sanskrit, please introduce yourself.\\n\\nSanskrit: I am Sanskrit, the divine language, the language of the gods. I am known for my precision, clarity, and beauty. I have been the foundation of Indian philosophy and spiritual practices, and my literature has enriched the lives of countless people throughout the ages.\\n\\nModerator: Thank you, Sanskrit. Let us now start the debate with Tamil presenting the opening remarks.\\n\\nTamil: Thank you. Tamil has a distinct identity, a unique sound, and a vibrant culture that has thrived independently for thousands of years. We have contributed vastly to the world's repository of knowledge and art, including some of the earliest Tamil Sangam literature, the ancient grammar of Tolkappiyam, and numerous forms of devotional poetry and classical music. This independent and continuous tradition gives Tamil immense value.\\n\\nSanskrit: While I concede that Tamil has a rich cultural heritage, it must be highlighted that Sanskrit has been the foundation of Indian civilization, influencing numerous languages and cultures throughout the Indian subcontinent. Sanskrit is the language of the Vedas, the Upanishads, and the Epics – works that have provided the framework for Indian literature, philosophy, and the arts. My reach extends beyond India as well, with Sanskrit echoing in the literature, arts, and languages of Southeast Asia.\\n\\nTamil: Indeed, Sanskrit has had a wide-ranging influence. However, does influence equate to superiority? Tamil's distinct identity and uniqueness have fostered a strong sense of self-awareness, cultural pride, and resilience. This has enabled Tamil to thrive in various regions, like Sri Lanka, Singapore, and Malaysia, in the face of colonization and modernization. This resilience and adaptability speak volumes about Tamil's relevance and continued relevance.\\n\\nSanskrit: I would argue that influence does contribute to the superiority of a language, especially in terms of its ability to preserve and disseminate knowledge. Sacred and philosophical texts in Sanskrit have been preserved meticulously, allowing future generations to access the wisdom of ancient India. Furthermore, the prestige associated with Sanskrit encouraged generations of scholars and intellectuals to study and preserve the language, which, in turn, facilitated the preservation of knowledge.\\n\\nTamil: While preservation of knowledge is unquestionably important, it must be acknowledged that insisting on Sanskrit being the sole or primary language of knowledge has led to the suppression of other voices and systems of knowledge. For instance, the status of Sanskrit as the \\\"high\\\" language hindered the development of vernaculars and even led to the demise of other Dravidian languages. It's essential to respect language diversity without the need for one to dominate the others.\\n\\nSanskrit: Sanskrit was never intended to suppress other languages or knowledge systems, but rather acting as a bridge to connect them. For instance, the Sanskrit grammarians, like Panini, were instrumental in formulating the rules and structure for the Sanskrit language, which then influenced the grammarians of vernacular languages, allowing them to establish frameworks for their languages. Sanskrit has acted as a seed for the growth of numerous languages.\\n\\nModerator: Thank you both for your extensive and insightful remarks. It is evident that both Tamil and Sanskrit have remarkable qualities and invaluable contributions to Indian civilization and culture. Today's debate has shed light on the uniqueness and richness of both languages. The goal of this debate was not to declare a winner or proclaim one as superior but to celebrate the di\\n\\n(Lights fade out as the conversation continues, leaving the audience with much to contemplate on the fascinating histories, cultural significance, and complex relationships of Tamil and Sanskrit.)\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/248", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Can you help me create a comprehensive and in depth reddit strategy for FC barcelona based on the following:\\n\\nTitle: Creating a Comprehensive Reddit Strategy for FC Barcelona: Deepening Fan Engagement and Strengthening Connections with the Unofficial Reddit Community\\n\\nIntroduction:\\n\\nAs the popularity of Reddit continues to grow, professional soccer clubs have an opportunity to engage with their fanbase and connect with unofficial fan communities on this platform. With over 125,000 members in the existing FC Barcelona community subreddit, there's a significant audience that can be targeted to deepen the connection between the official club and the unofficial Reddit community.\\n\\nObjectives:\\n\\nThe objectives of the Reddit strategy for FC Barcelona are:\\n\\nDeepen the connection between the official club and the unofficial Reddit community\\nGenerate further engagement with fans, particularly those who can't usually attend games\\nIncrease the visibility of FC Barcelona on Reddit\\nBuild a positive brand reputation for FC Barcelona on Reddit\\nTarget Audience:\\n\\nThe target audience for the Reddit strategy for FC Barcelona are FC Barcelona fans with a focus on the global audience who can't usually attend games. This includes fans who are active on Reddit and members of the existing FC Barcelona community subreddit.\\n\\nKey Components of the Strategy:\\n\\nEngaging with the existing FC Barcelona community subreddit: The strategy will involve regular engagement with the existing community subreddit, such as sharing official club updates, responding to fan comments, and hosting Q&A sessions with club representatives.\\n\\nRunning targeted campaigns and contests: The strategy will also involve running targeted campaigns and contests on Reddit to generate further engagement with fans. For example, the club could run a fan art contest or a prediction challenge for upcoming games.\\n\\nLeveraging Reddit's advertising platform: The strategy will also involve leveraging Reddit's advertising platform to increase the visibility of the club on the platform. This could involve targeted ads to reach specific fan segments or sponsored posts to highlight official club news and updates.\\n\\nResources:\\n\\nThe resources needed to implement this strategy include:\\n\\nDedicated personnel to manage and execute the strategy, including community managers, social media managers, and content creators.\\nA budget for running targeted campaigns and leveraging Reddit's advertising platform.\\nTime and resources to create high-quality content and engage with fans on the platform.\\nOverall, this comprehensive Reddit strategy for FC Barcelona aims to deepen the connection with the unofficial Reddit community, generate further engagement with fans, and increase the visibility of the club on Reddit.\", \"response\": \"Sure, I can help you create a comprehensive and in-depth Reddit strategy for FC Barcelona based on the objectives and key components outlined.\\n\\nTo start, it's important to have a clear understanding of the objectives of the strategy and the target audience you're trying to reach. The objectives of the strategy are to deepen the connection between the official club and the unofficial Reddit community, generate further engagement with fans, increase the visibility of FC Barcelona on Reddit, and build a positive brand reputation for the club on the platform. The target audience is FC Barcelona fans with a focus on the global audience who can't usually attend games.\\n\\nEngaging with the existing FC Barcelona community subreddit is a key component of the strategy. This can be done by sharing official club updates, responding to fan comments, and hosting Q&A sessions with club representatives. Regular engagement with the community can help to build a positive relationship with fans and strengthen the connection between the club and the Reddit community.\\n\\nRunning targeted campaigns and contests on Reddit can also help to generate further engagement with fans. For example, the club could run a fan art contest or a prediction challenge for upcoming games. These types of activities can help to create a sense of community and build excitement around the club.\\n\\nLeveraging Reddit's advertising platform can also be a valuable tool for increasing the visibility of the club on the platform. This can involve targeted ads to reach specific fan segments or sponsored posts to highlight official club news and updates.\\n\\nTo implement this strategy, you will need dedicated personnel to manage and execute the strategy, including community managers, social media managers, and content creators. You will also need a budget for running targeted campaigns and leveraging Reddit's advertising platform. Additionally, you will need time and resources to create high-quality content and engage with fans on the platform.\\n\\nOverall, this comprehensive Reddit strategy for FC Barcelona aims to deepen the connection with the unofficial Reddit community, generate further engagement with fans, and increase the visibility of the club on Reddit. By engaging with the existing community, running targeted campaigns and contests, leveraging Reddit's advertising platform, and having dedicated personnel to manage and execute the strategy, FC Barcelona can achieve these objectives and strengthen their connection with their global fan base.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/691", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"instagram api\", \"response\": \"I'm here to help answer your questions to the best of my ability. However, I should clarify that I don't have access to any specific systems or APIs, including the Instagram API. I can provide general information and guidance based on the information you give me.\\n\\nWhen it comes to using the Instagram API, there are a few things to keep in mind. First, you'll need to create an Instagram Developer account and register your application to get access to the API. This will give you an access token that you can use to make requests to the API.\\n\\nOnce you have access to the API, you can use it to perform a variety of tasks, such as:\\n\\n* Getting information about a user's profile\\n* Retrieving a list of a user's recent posts\\n* Getting information about a specific post\\n* Searching for posts with a specific hashtag\\n* Getting a list of users who have liked or commented on a post\\n\\nIt's important to note that the Instagram API has certain usage limits and restrictions, so you'll need to be mindful of these when making requests. Additionally, you should always make sure to handle any sensitive data, such as user access tokens, securely and responsibly.\\n\\nI hope this information is helpful! Let me know if you have any other questions.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/1001", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"hi! i am ivy working for a sporting goods manufacturing company. I am working in it's ecommence department and I need to provide new product ideas in the coming Brain Storm meeting.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure! Let's come up with some ideas together. I'll start by asking you some questions about your company and the types of products you already make.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nLet me give you some background of my company before we start\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSounds good. Tell me a little bit about your company.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nMy company is called Tri-Great USA CORP. Tri-Great USA CORP is launched 2014, young but full of energy, fresh while matured by owning a wealth of experience in sales and after-sales service team.Tri-Great USA CORP is aim to provide domestic market service by having warehouse in Los Angeles and on-line stores which concentrate on selling its private brand \\\"Net Playz\\\" and \\\"E-Jet Sport\\\" through the booming worldwide internet platform.\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nGreat, thank you for that information! I have a better understanding of your company now. I’ll use this knowledge to help generate new product ideas for you.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nLet me give you more information about our existing product before we start\", \"response\": \"Sure, here are some ideas for new products that you could consider for your upcoming brainstorm meeting:\\n \\n\\n 1. Sportswear: You could consider expanding your product line to include sportswear such as t-shirts, shorts, and leggings for various sports and activities. This could include both functional and fashion-forward pieces that cater to a wide range of customers, from casual athletes to serious competitors. You could also consider creating a line of custom sportswear for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n 2. Accessories: Another option is to expand your product line to include sports accessories such as water bottles, towels, and bags. These types of products are often overlooked, but they can be a valuable addition to your offering and provide customers with a complete sports experience. You could also consider creating custom accessories for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n 3. Equipment: If your company specializes in sporting goods, you could consider expanding your product line to include new types of equipment such as balls, bats, and other sports-specific gear. This could include both recreational and professional-level equipment, catering to a wide range of customers and sports. You could also consider creating custom equipment for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n 4. Technology: With the increasing popularity of technology in sports, you could consider expanding your product line to include sports technology such as wearable devices, sensors, and other tracking devices. These types of products can provide athletes with valuable data and insights into their performance, helping them to improve and reach their goals. You could also consider creating custom technology for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n 5. Health and wellness: With the growing focus on health and wellness, you could consider expanding your product line to include health and wellness products such as supplements, nutrition bars, and other wellness products. These types of products can be a valuable addition to your offering, providing customers with a complete sports and wellness experience. You could also consider creating custom health and wellness products for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n 6. Education: Another option is to expand your product line to include educational resources such as training programs, tutorials, and other educational materials. These types of products can help athletes and sports enthusiasts to improve their skills and knowledge, and can be a valuable addition to your offering. You could also consider creating custom educational resources for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n 7. Entertainment: Finally, you could consider expanding your product line to include entertainment products such as games, toys, and other recreational products. These types of products can provide customers with a fun and engaging experience, and can be a valuable addition to your offering. You could also consider creating custom entertainment products for teams and organizations.\\n \\n\\n These are just a few ideas to get you started. The key is to consider your company's strengths, target audience, and the needs of your customers when developing new product ideas. By expanding your product line to include new and innovative products, you can not only increase your customer base, but also provide customers with a complete and comprehensive sports and wellness experience.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "0", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
