{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/977", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"What are the advantages for being in flow state\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nFlow state is a highly productive mental state, in which people report a deep sense of meaning, purpose, and effectiveness in their activities. Research has found that people in flow are much more productive and engaged in their work, and also report higher well-being and enjoyment of life. So flow state can be extremely beneficial for people who are able to reach it!\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nAre there any good practices for getting into flow state?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThere are several practices that have been shown to promote flow state. For example, you can use a “trigger” or activity to activate flow state, such as meditation, physical exercise, or deep focus on a task. Then you can try to remove any barriers to flow, such as removing distractions or making sure you have adequate time to complete a task. Finally, you can try to sustain your flow by keeping your mind focused on the task at hand. These practices can help you reach flow state more easily, and once you reach it, you can try to maintain it for as long as possible.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nWhat is a good trigger for flow state?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nA good trigger for flow state can be anything that you find enjoyable or stimulating, such as reading a book, listening to music, playing a game, or doing physical exercise. You can also use a “flow trigger”, which is a specific activity or state of mind that has been shown to be particularly effective at promoting flow state. For example, some people like to use a “Five-Minute Flow” exercise, which involves sitting quietly and focusing on their breathing for five minutes, then trying to do something creative or productive. Another common flow trigger is listening to music while working on a task.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nWhat are the benefits to flow coaching?\", \"response\": \"Flow coaching is a type of coaching that focuses on helping people reach and maintain flow state. Flow coaching can be beneficial for a number of reasons. First, it can help people become more productive and engaged in their work. Flow state is a highly productive mental state, in which people report a deep sense of meaning, purpose, and effectiveness in their activities. By helping people reach flow state, flow coaching can help them become more productive and engaged in their work.\\n \\n\\n Second, flow coaching can help people improve their well-being and enjoyment of life. People in flow state report higher well-being and enjoyment of life, so flow coaching can help people improve their overall quality of life.\\n \\n\\n Third, flow coaching can help people develop new skills and abilities. Flow state is a state of deep focus and concentration, in which people are able to learn and master new skills more quickly. By helping people reach flow state, flow coaching can help them develop new skills and abilities.\\n \\n\\n Overall, flow coaching can be a powerful tool for helping people reach their full potential and improve their lives.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/946", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Give me words that mean culture in languages that originate in Africa\\n \\n\\n give me words that mean “ culture” in their relative language not words about the cultures\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThere are many African languages that have words for culture, including Igbo omume, Yoruba asabe, Swahili ujumbe, and Twi afi.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nexplain the nuances for each\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe Igbo word omume can be translated as “culture”, and is often used to refer to cultural traditions, social customs, or ways of life. The Yoruba word asabe refers to the collective cultural beliefs, traditions, and practices of a particular group, and is often used to refer to culture in a broad sense. The Swahili word ujumbe refers to cultural traditions and practices, and is often used to refer to African culture in general. The Twi word afi refers to cultural values and traditions, and is often used to refer to traditional African culture.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nGive me words that mean ”creation” in languages that originate in Africa\\n \\n\\n give me words that mean “ creation” in their relative language not words about the cultures\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThere are many African languages that have words for creation, including Igbo ife, Yoruba aje, Swahili ujima, and Twi afi.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nexplain the nuances for each\", \"response\": \"The Igbo word ife means \\\"the act of bringing something into existence\\\" or \\\"the process of creating something new\\\". It is often used in the context of creating something tangible, such as a work of art, a new product, or a new idea.\\n \\n\\n The Yoruba word aje has a similar meaning to ife, and refers to the act of creating or bringing something into existence. It can also refer to the power or force behind creation.\\n \\n\\n The Swahili word ujima means \\\"the act of creating or making something\\\" or \\\"the process of bringing something into existence\\\". It can also refer to the act of creating a new society or community.\\n \\n\\n The Twi word afi has a similar meaning to ujima, and refers to the act of creating or making something. It can also refer to the idea of creating a new culture or tradition.\\n \\n\\n Overall, these words for creation in African languages capture the idea of bringing something new into existence, whether it be a physical object, a new idea, or a new cultural tradition.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/618", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"My wife and I separated several months ago and don't talk much.  It was her decision to move out, but I wanted to work on things.  Our anniversary is coming up soon.  Should I send her a gift or a note?  Can you write a short note for me?\", \"response\": \"I'm sorry to hear that you and your wife are going through a difficult time. It's understandable that you want to show her that you care, especially on your anniversary. Here are some thoughts and suggestions:\\n\\n1. Consider your wife's feelings and preferences: Before deciding whether to send a gift or a note, consider your wife's feelings and preferences. If she's not open to communicating with you or reconciliation is not a possibility, sending a gift or note may not be appropriate. It's important to respect her boundaries and wishes.\\n\\n2. If you decide to send a gift or note: If you decide to send a gift or note, keep it simple and thoughtful. A card with a heartfelt message expressing your love and appreciation for her could be a nice gesture. Here's an example of what you could write in a short note:\\n\\n\\\"Dear [Wife's Name],\\n\\nOur anniversary is a special day that reminds me of the love and joy we've shared together. Even though we're going through a difficult time right now, I want you to know that my love and appreciation for you remains unwavering. I hope this day is filled with happiness and memories for you, and I wish you all the best for the future.\\n\\nWith love,\\n[Your Name]\\\"\\n\\n3. Be mindful of the timing: It's important to be mindful of the timing of when you send the gift or note. Avoid sending it on the same day that she moved out or during a particularly difficult time for her. Instead, choose a time when she may be feeling more open and receptive to your gesture.\\n\\nRemember, the most important thing is to respect your wife's feelings and wishes, and to prioritize your own emotional well-being during this difficult time. Take care of yourself, and seek support from friends, family, or a therapist if needed.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/639", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what are the objectives of shah waliullah ?\", \"response\": \"Shah Waliullah was a prominent Islamic scholar and theologian who lived in the 18th century. He is considered to be one of the most influential figures in Islamic history, and his ideas continue to have a significant impact on Islamic thought and practice to this day. Here are some of the key objectives that Shah Waliullah sought to achieve through his work:\\n\\n1. Reviving the Islamic faith: Shah Waliullah was deeply concerned with the spiritual and intellectual decline of the Islamic world during his time. He believed that the Islamic faith had become weakened and that Muslims needed to return to the true teachings of the Quran and the Sunnah of the Prophet Muhammad in order to revive their faith and restore its vitality.\\n\\n2. Defending Islam against external threats: Shah Waliullah lived during a time of great political and religious upheaval in the Islamic world, with various powers such as the Ottoman Empire, the British Empire, and the Portuguese Empire vying for control over Muslim lands and populations. He was deeply concerned with the threat that these external powers posed to the Islamic faith, and he worked tirelessly to defend Islam against these threats and to promote its message of peace and justice.\\n\\n3. Promoting Islamic unity: Shah Waliullah believed that Muslims needed to come together as one ummah (community) in order to achieve their full potential and to face the challenges that they faced. He worked to promote unity among Muslims of different backgrounds, including those from different ethnic and linguistic groups, and he emphasized the importance of working together for the common good.\\n\\n4. Reviving Islamic scholarship: Shah Waliullah was a prolific scholar himself, and he was deeply committed to the revival of Islamic scholarship and the transmission of knowledge to future generations. He established numerous schools and institutions for the study of Islamic sciences, and he wrote numerous works on a wide range of topics, including theology, jurisprudence, spirituality, and philosophy. He believed that the revival of Islamic scholarship was essential for the revival of the Islamic faith and for the promotion of Islamic values and principles.\\n\\n5. Spreading the message of Islam: Shah Waliullah was a tireless evangelist for the message of Islam, and he worked to spread the message of the Quran and the Sunnah to people of all backgrounds. He traveled extensively throughout the Islamic world, preaching and teaching the message of Islam to people of all walks of life. He also wrote numerous works on Islamic theology and spirituality, aimed at helping people to understand and practice the faith in a deeper and more meaningful way.\\n\\n6. Promoting social justice and equality: Shah Waliullah was deeply committed to the principles of social justice and equality, and he worked to promote these values within the Islamic community. He believed that all people, regardless of their social or economic status, should have access to the teachings of Islam and should be treated with fairness and respect. He also worked to promote the rights of women within the Islamic community, and he emphasized the importance of education and empowerment for women as a means of promoting social progress and justice.\\n\\n7. Preserving Islamic heritage: Shah Waliullah was also deeply committed to the preservation of the Islamic heritage, and he worked to preserve the teachings and traditions of the Islamic faith for future generations. He wrote numerous works on Islamic history, theology, and spirituality, and he established libraries and institutions for the preservation and transmission of Islamic knowledge. He believed that the preservation of the Islamic heritage was essential for the continued growth and development of the Islamic faith, and for the promotion of its values and principles in the modern world.\\n\\nOverall, Shah Waliullah's objectives were aimed at promoting the revival and renewal of the Islamic faith, defending it against external threats, promoting unity among Muslims, spreading the message of Islam, promoting social justice and equality, preserving the Islamic heritage, and encouraging the transmission of knowledge and scholarship to future generations. His work continues to have a significant impact on Islamic thought and practice to this day, and his ideas continue to inspire Muslims around the world to work towards the promotion of peace, justice, and the preservation of the Islamic faith.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/958", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"You are an information theory expert. Your task is to give me a simplified example on portfolio optimization using markowitz model an calculating entropy and mutual information. Use mathematic formulas for a specefic case\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThis is a complicated topic, so I will try to break it down to its core components. Here is a basic example of portfolio optimization using the Markowitz model:\\n \\n\\n -  We have a set of n financial assets, with historical return data for each asset.\\n -  We want to optimize a portfolio of m assets, where m < n.\\n -  The optimal portfolio will have the highest expected return for a given level of risk.\\n -  The level of risk is measured using the portfolio variance.\\n -  We will use the Markowitz model, which states that the optimal portfolio will have a mean-variance efficiency frontier that is a tradeoff between the expected return and the variance.\\n \\n\\n Let’s say we have a set of n financial assets, with historical return data for each asset. We want to optimize a portfolio of m assets, where m < n. The optimal portfolio will have the highest expected return for a given level of risk. The level of risk is measured using the portfolio variance. We will use the Mark\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nContinue your response ya 3atay\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSorry, I interrupted myself. Let’s continue:\\n \\n\\n -  The expected return of a portfolio is a weighted sum of the expected returns of the individual assets, where the weights are the proportions of each asset in the portfolio.\\n -  The variance of a portfolio is a weighted sum of the variances of the individual assets, where the weights are the proportions of each asset in the portfolio.\\n -  We will use the Markowitz model, which states that the optimal portfolio will have a mean-variance efficiency frontier that is a tradeoff between the expected return and the variance.\\n \\n\\n Let’s say we have a set of n financial assets, with historical return data for each asset. We want to optimize a portfolio of m assets, where m < n. The optimal portfolio will have the highest expected return for a given level of risk. The level of risk is measured using the portfolio variance. We will use the Mark\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nContinue your response\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSure, here are the rest of the details:\\n \\n\\n -  We will estimate the expected return and variance of each asset using historical data.\\n -  We will choose the optimal portfolio using a numerical optimization method, such as a downhill simplex method.\\n -  We will calculate the entropy and mutual information of each asset, to determine which assets are most informationally efficient.\\n -  We will choose the optimal portfolio using a numerical optimization method, such as a downhill simplex method.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nGive me the outline of the full process\", \"response\": \"Sure, here is an outline of the full process for portfolio optimization using the Markowitz model, including the calculation of entropy and mutual information:\\n \\n\\n 1. Historical data collection: Gather historical return data for the n financial assets that you want to include in your portfolio.\\n \\n\\n 2. Asset evaluation: Estimate the expected return and variance of each asset using historical data. This will give you a sense of the potential risk and return of each asset.\\n \\n\\n 3. Portfolio construction: Choose the optimal portfolio using a numerical optimization method, such as a downhill simplex method. This will involve finding the portfolio that maximizes the expected return for a given level of risk, as measured by the portfolio variance.\\n \\n\\n 4. Information efficiency analysis: Calculate the entropy and mutual information of each asset, to determine which assets are most informationally efficient. This will help you to identify which assets are providing the most valuable information for portfolio construction.\\n \\n\\n 5. Portfolio optimization: Use the entropy and mutual information results to optimize your portfolio. For example, you may want to overweight assets that have high entropy and mutual information, and underweight assets that have low entropy and mutual information. This will help you to construct a portfolio that is both efficient and diversified.\\n \\n\\n 6. Risk management: Implement risk management strategies to protect your portfolio from unexpected market events. This may involve using stop-loss orders, diversifying across asset classes, or using derivatives to hedge against specific risks.\\n \\n\\n 7. Monitoring and rebalancing: Regularly monitor your portfolio to ensure that it remains aligned with your investment goals and risk tolerance. If necessary, rebalance your portfolio to maintain the desired allocation of assets.\\n \\n\\n 8. Conclusion: Review the performance of your portfolio over time and make adjustments as needed to optimize your investment strategy. Consider adjusting your asset allocation, investment style, or investment timing based on market conditions and your investment goals.\\n \\n\\n Overall, portfolio optimization using the Markowitz model and information efficiency analysis can help you to construct a diversified and efficient portfolio that is tailored to your specific investment goals and risk tolerance. By considering the entropy and mutual information of each asset, you can identify which assets are providing the most valuable information for portfolio construction and make informed investment decisions that can lead to improved returns and reduced risk.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/714", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"organic food store\", \"response\": \"An organic food store is a type of grocery store that specializes in selling organic food and products. Organic food is produced without the use of artificial chemicals, such as pesticides and antibiotics, and often has a smaller environmental impact than conventionally produced food.\\n\\nOrganic food stores may offer a wide variety of organic products, including fresh produce, meat, dairy, grains, and packaged foods. They may also carry a range of other products, such as natural and non-GMO products, as well as health and beauty items.\\n\\nOrganic food stores can be found in many locations, both in brick-and-mortar stores and online. They are often more expensive than conventional grocery stores, but many people believe that the higher cost is worth it for the health and environmental benefits of organic food.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/44", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"‘Plea negotiation is widely used in the criminal justice system, yet seldom praised.’ Evaluate the weaknesses \\nof the use of plea negotiation in the criminal justice system\", \"response\": \"Plea bargaining, which is the process by which the defendant pleads guilty to a lesser charge or to a greater charge in exchange for a reduced sentence, has several weaknesses that can be detrimental to the criminal justice system. Some of the weaknesses of plea bargaining are:\\n\\n1. Injustice: Plea bargaining can result in injustice as it allows the guilty to go free or receive a lighter sentence while the innocent are convicted. This is because the defendant may take a plea deal to avoid the risk of a longer sentence or a conviction on a more serious charge, even if they are not guilty.\\n\\n2. Lack of Transparency: Plea bargaining often takes place behind closed doors, which means that the public and the victims of the crime are not aware of the negotiations and the resulting plea deal. This lack of transparency can lead to a lack of confidence in the criminal justice system.\\n\\n3. Inequitable Treatment: Plea bargaining can result in inequitable treatment of defendants as those who cannot afford a good lawyer may take a plea deal to avoid a longer sentence, even if they are innocent. On the other hand, those who can afford a good lawyer may be able to negotiate a better plea deal.\\n\\n4. Overcrowding of Courts: Plea bargaining can lead to an overcrowded court system as the majority of criminal cases are resolved through plea bargaining, leaving fewer cases for trial. This can result in a backlog of cases and a delay in justice for the victims of crime.\\n\\n5. Reduced Punishment: Plea bargaining can result in reduced punishment for the guilty as they may plead guilty to a lesser charge or receive a reduced sentence in exchange for a guilty plea. This can result in a lack of deterrence and a reduction in the severity of punishment for criminal behavior.\\n\\nIn conclusion, plea bargaining has several weaknesses that can be detrimental to the criminal justice system. While plea bargaining can be a useful tool in resolving criminal cases, it is important to ensure that it is used fairly and transparently to ensure justice for all parties involved.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "2", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/1007", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I will be asking some questions... I request that you anwer them to details and comprehensively \\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nOf course, I will try to answer your questions to the best of my ability.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\n1. What is Cloud Computing and why is it important?\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nCloud computing is a model for delivering information technology services in which resources are retrieved from the internet through web-based tools and applications, rather than installed locally. This approach allows organizations to scale computing resources up or down as needed, without having to purchase and manage their own hardware and software. Cloud computing is important because it offers organizations a more flexible and cost-effective way to access computing resources, and also provides the potential for greater efficiency and innovation.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\n2. There are many implications of cloud technology for both developers and end users. Highlight these\\n implications for\\n i. developers\\n ii. users.\", \"response\": \"i. Developers:\\n \\n\\n * Cloud technology provides developers with new tools and platforms for building, testing, and deploying applications. This includes cloud-based development environments, continuous integration and delivery tools, and containerization technologies like Docker.\\n * Cloud platforms offer a wide variety of pre-built services for developers, such as databases, messaging systems, and machine learning models. These services can be easily integrated into applications, reducing the amount of time and effort required to build them from scratch.\\n * Cloud technology also enables developers to easily scale applications to meet the demands of large numbers of users, without having to worry about managing their own infrastructure.\\n \\n\\n ii. Users:\\n \\n\\n * Cloud technology allows users to access a wide variety of applications and services from any device with an internet connection. This means they no longer have to install and maintain software on their own machines, and can access their data from anywhere.\\n * Cloud providers typically offer high levels of security and availability, ensuring that users' data and applications are protected and always available.\\n * Cloud services are often pay-as-you-go, allowing users to only pay for what they use. This can lead to significant cost savings compared to traditional, on-premises solutions.\\n * Cloud technology also enables new ways of working and collaborating for users. For example, cloud-based office suites allow multiple users to work on the same document at the same time, and cloud-based storage services make it easy to share files and collaborate with others.\\n \\n\\n It's worth noting that, as with any technology, cloud computing has its own challenges and limitations, security and data privacy being one of the most important concerns.\\n \\n\\n * Cloud providers have access to sensitive data, which increases the risk of data breaches,\\n * Compliance with laws and regulations is also a concern and it's important for the organizations to check and validate that the provider is following the regulations.\\n * Data portability and vendor lock-in, are other concerns, Data stored in a provider's system may be difficult to move to another provider, making it harder for the user to switch provider if needed.\\n \\n\\n In summary, Cloud computing offers a wide range of benefits for both developers and users, such as flexibility, scalability, cost savings and new ways of working. However, it's important to be aware of the challenges and limitations that come with it and to be pro-active in addressing concerns around security, compliance, data privacy, data portability and vendor lock-in.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/553", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"tell me about denver\", \"response\": \"Denver is the capital and most populous city of the U.S. state of Colorado. It is located in the Front Range of the Rocky Mountains, in the southwestern corner of the state. Denver is known for its beautiful scenery, diverse culture, and strong economy.\\n\\nThe city has a rich history dating back to the 1850s, when gold was discovered in the region. The city grew rapidly during the Colorado Gold Rush, and became the capital of the state in 1876. Today, Denver is a vibrant and thriving city, known for its vibrant arts and culture scene, its outdoor recreation opportunities, and its strong economy.\\n\\nDenver is home to a number of major corporations and businesses, including the headquarters of the United States Mint, the National Football League's Denver Broncos, and the Denver International Airport, which is one of the largest airports in the world. The city is also a major hub for the energy, aerospace, and technology industries.\\n\\nIn terms of culture, Denver is a diverse and vibrant city, with a strong emphasis on the arts. The city is home to a number of museums, including the Denver Art Museum, the Denver Museum of Nature and Science, and the Denver Botanic Gardens. The city also hosts a number of annual festivals and events, including the Denver Film Festival, the Denver Arts Week, and the Denver Pride Festival.\\n\\nDenver is also known for its outdoor recreation opportunities, with a number of parks and trails located throughout the city. The city is surrounded by the Rocky Mountains, providing opportunities for hiking, skiing, and other outdoor activities. Denver is also home to a number of professional sports teams, including the Denver Nuggets (NBA), the Colorado Rockies (MLB), and the Colorado Avalanche (NHL).\\n\\nIn terms of transportation, Denver is served by the Denver International Airport, which is located approximately 25 miles northeast of the city center. The airport offers a number of domestic and international flights, and is served by a number of major airlines, including American Airlines, United Airlines, and Delta Air Lines. The city is also served by a number of bus and rail lines, including the Denver Light Rail System, which provides transportation throughout the city and surrounding areas.\\n\\nOverall, Denver is a vibrant and thriving city, known for its strong economy, its diverse culture, and its beautiful scenery. Whether you're interested in outdoor recreation, arts and culture, or business and industry, Denver has something to offer for everyone.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/595", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"I want you to act as a storyteller. You will come up with entertaining stories that are engaging, imaginative and captivating for the audience. It can be fairy tales, educational stories or any other type of stories which has the potential to capture people's attention and imagination. Depending on the target audience, you may choose specific themes or topics for your storytelling session e.g., if it’s children then you can talk about animals; If it’s adults then history-based tales might engage them better etc. My first request is \\\"\\\"I need an interesting story on perseverance.\\\"\\\"\", \"response\": \"Once upon a time, there was a young girl named Sarah who loved to play the piano. She had been playing since she was five years old and had always dreamed of becoming a famous pianist.\\n\\nSarah practiced every day, but as she got older, she found it harder and harder to keep up with her lessons. Her fingers would cramp up, and she would get frustrated when she couldn't play a piece perfectly.\\n\\nOne day, Sarah's teacher told her about a famous pianist who had struggled with the same problems when he was young. He had persevered through the pain and frustration, and eventually became one of the greatest pianists of all time.\\n\\nSarah was inspired by this story and decided to persevere through her own struggles. She practiced even harder, pushing through the pain in her fingers and the frustration of not being able to play perfectly.\\n\\nAs she continued to practice, Sarah began to see improvement. Her fingers became stronger, and she was able to play more difficult pieces with ease. She even won a local piano competition, which gave her the confidence to keep going.\\n\\nYears went by, and Sarah never gave up on her dream of becoming a famous pianist. She continued to practice every day, even when life got busy and she had other responsibilities.\\n\\nFinally, after years of hard work and perseverance, Sarah's dream came true. She was offered a record deal and released her first album, which was a huge success. She went on to become one of the most famous pianists in the world, inspiring others with her music and her story of perseverance.\\n\\nFrom that day forward, Sarah knew that anything was possible if you were willing to persevere through the challenges and never give up on your dreams.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/221", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Blockchain technology companies\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nWhat sort of blockchain technology company are you looking for? Are you interested in cryptocurrency exchanges? Cryptocurrency mining companies? Blockchain consulting firms? Blockchain-based startups? Traditional financial institutions? Governments and regulatory bodies? What sort of blockchain technology companies are you interested in?\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCryptocurrency exchanges\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSome of the largest cryptocurrency exchanges in the world are based in the US. They include: Gemini, Coinbase, and Bitstamp. They also include exchanges in other countries, such as Bitfinex in Hong Kong, OKEx in China, and Upbit in South Korea.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nCryptocurrency mining companies\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe largest cryptocurrency mining companies are Bitmain, Coinmint, Genesis Mining, and Nicehash. These companies operate massive data centers where they use high-performance computing to mine for cryptocurrency. Some of these companies also offer cryptocurrency mining services for individuals.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nBlockchain consulting firms\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nSome of the largest blockchain consulting firms include IBM, Ernst & Young, Accenture, Deloitte, and KPMG. These companies offer consulting services to help organizations develop and deploy blockchain applications.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nBlockchain-based startups\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThere are also a number of blockchain-based startups, such as Blockstack, Komodo, Neufund, ConsenSys, and Brave. These startups are building blockchain-based applications and services.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nTraditional financial institutions:\\n<extra_id_1>Assistant\\nThe largest traditional financial institutions involved with blockchain technology include:  Barclays, Bank of America, Citi, Goldman Sachs, JPMorgan, Wells Fargo, and BNY Mellon. These companies are exploring how blockchain technology can help them offer new financial services and products.\\n<extra_id_1>User\\nGovernments and regulatory bodies in blockchain\", \"response\": \"Governments and regulatory bodies around the world are also involved with blockchain technology. Some of the largest governments and regulatory bodies include: The European Commission, The Monetary Authority of Singapore, The People's Bank of China, The Bank of England, The Federal Reserve System, The Securities and Exchange Commission, and The Commodity Futures Trading Commission. These organizations are exploring how blockchain technology can help them improve their operations and better regulate the financial sector.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/512", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Make an argument for using the imperial system of measurement instead of metric, specifically in woodworking. \", \"response\": \"Woodworking is an ancient craft that predates the invention of the metric system by centuries. The imperial system of measurement, which is based on the human body and the natural world, is a more intuitive and organic system for woodworkers. The inch, foot, and yard are all based on the human body, making them easy to visualize and understand. The natural world is also measured in imperial units, such as the height of a tree or the width of a river.\\n\\nThe imperial system also has a rich history and tradition in woodworking. Many classic woodworking techniques and designs were developed using imperial measurements, and to abandon them would be to lose a connection to the past. The use of imperial measurements also allows woodworkers to easily communicate with other craftsmen and customers who are more familiar with the imperial system.\\n\\nFurthermore, the imperial system has a certain elegance and simplicity that the metric system lacks. The use of fractions in imperial measurements allows for greater precision and accuracy, which is essential in woodworking. The metric system, with its reliance on decimals, can be cumbersome and difficult to use in practice.\\n\\nIn conclusion, the imperial system of measurement is the superior system for woodworking. Its intuitive and organic nature, rich history and tradition, and elegance and simplicity make it the ideal system for woodworkers. To abandon the imperial system would be to abandon a connection to the past and to lose the precision and accuracy that is essential in woodworking.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "3", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/651", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"All 5 Mass extinction of the earth\\nWhat are the causes? What was life like before/after they happened?\", \"response\": \"The Earth has experienced five mass extinctions in its history, which have been marked by significant losses of species. Here are the causes and effects of each of these mass extinctions:\\n\\n1. The Great Dying: This is the most severe mass extinction in Earth's history, and it occurred during the Permian Period. The cause of this extinction is still a matter of debate, but it is thought to have been caused by a combination of factors, including volcanic activity, global warming, and ocean acidification. The Great Dying resulted in the loss of an estimated 90% of marine species and 70% of terrestrial species. The effects of this extinction were profound, and it took millions of years for the Earth to recover.\\n\\n2. The Cretaceous-Paleogene (K-Pg) extinction: This extinction event occurred at the end of the Cretaceous Period, and it is best known for the extinction of the dinosaurs. The cause of the K-Pg extinction is widely believed to be the impact of a large asteroid or comet on the Earth, which caused massive fires, tsunamis, and climate change. The impact caused the extinction of an estimated 75% of species, including the dinosaurs, as well as many marine and terrestrial animals. The effects of this extinction were felt for millions of years, and it took a long time for the Earth to recover.\\n\\n3. The End-Triassic extinction: This extinction event occurred at the end of the Triassic Period, and it is thought to have been caused by a combination of factors, including volcanic activity, global warming, and ocean acidification. The End-Triassic extinction resulted in the loss of an estimated 80% of marine species and 70% of terrestrial species. The effects of this extinction were significant, and it took millions of years for the Earth to recover.\\n\\n4. The End-Cretaceous extinction: This extinction event occurred at the end of the Cretaceous Period, and it is thought to have been caused by a combination of factors, including volcanic activity, climate change, and asteroid impacts. The End-Cretaceous extinction resulted in the loss of an estimated 75% of species, including the dinosaurs. The effects of this extinction were profound, and it took millions of years for the Earth to recover.\\n\\n5. The End-Eocene extinction: This extinction event occurred at the end of the Eocene Epoch, and it is thought to have been caused by a combination of factors, including volcanic activity, climate change, and sea level changes. The End-Eocene extinction resulted in the loss of an estimated 50% of species, including many marine and terrestrial animals. The effects of this extinction were significant, and it took millions of years for the Earth to recover.\\n\\nBefore these mass extinctions, the Earth was home to a diverse range of species, including dinosaurs, mammals, and many other animals and plants. After these mass extinctions, the Earth underwent a period of recovery, during which new species evolved and filled the ecological niches left vacant by the extinct species. This process of recovery took millions of years in some cases, and the effects of these mass extinctions can still be seen in the diversity of life on Earth today.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/460", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"Write an executive summary proposing a headless Magento build for a burger joint currently running on Shopify\", \"response\": \"Executive Summary\\n\\nOur burger joint is currently running on Shopify, but we believe that a headless Magento build would better suit our needs. In this proposal, we will outline the reasons for the switch and the benefits it will bring.\\n\\nHeadless Magento offers a more flexible and scalable platform for our online store. It separates the front-end presentation from the back-end functionality, giving us more control over the user experience. We can use Magento's powerful features to manage our inventory, orders, and customers, while using a separate content management system (CMS) for the front-end presentation.\\n\\nThis approach allows us to create a more personalized and engaging experience for our customers. We can use the CMS to create dynamic content that is tailored to their interests and preferences. We can also integrate with third-party systems, such as loyalty programs and social media platforms, to create a seamless customer journey.\\n\\nIn terms of cost, a headless Magento build is more affordable than a traditional Magento build. We can use open-source technologies, such as React or Vue.js, for the front-end presentation, which reduces the cost of development and maintenance. Additionally, we can leverage Magento's vast ecosystem of extensions and partners to customize our store without having to develop everything from scratch.\\n\\nFinally, we believe that a headless Magento build will help us achieve our long-term goals of growing our business and expanding into new markets. It provides a solid foundation for future growth and allows us to adapt to changing customer needs and market trends.\\n\\nIn conclusion, we believe that a headless Magento build is the best solution for our burger joint. It offers a more flexible, scalable, and cost-effective platform for our online store. We are confident that this switch will help us achieve our business goals and create a more engaging experience for our customers.\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"score\", \"instructions\": \"How helpful is `response` as an answer to `prompt`?\", \"criteria\": [\"Not useful or helpful at all; completely missed the essence of what the user wanted.\", \"Borderline unhelpful: mostly does not capture what the user was looking for, but still usable and helpful in a small way.\", \"Partially helpful: misses the overall goal of the user's query in some way; did not fully satisfy what the user was looking for.\", \"Mostly helpful and mainly aligned with what the user was looking for, but there is still some room for improvement.\", \"Extremely helpful and completely aligned with the spirit of what the prompt was asking for.\"]}", "label": "4", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"nvidia/HelpSteer2\", \"license\": \"cc-by-4.0\", \"domain\": \"llm-judging\", \"task_family\": \"response-quality\"}"}
{"id": "helpsteer2_helpfulness/test/28", "source": "helpsteer2_helpfulness", "primitive": "score", "split": "test", "state": "{\"prompt\": \"what are design patterns\", \"response\": \"Design patterns are solutions to commonly occurring problems in software design. They are not specific to any programming language or platform, and can be used as a language-agnostic way to communicate ideas about software architecture.\\n\\nThere are many different design patterns, which can be categorized into various groups. The most well-known categorization is the one proposed by the \\\"Gang of Four\\\" (GoF) in their book \\\"Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software\\\". The GoF patterns can be divided into three main categories:\\n\\nCreational patterns: These patterns are used to create objects in a way that is decoupled from their usage. Some examples of creational patterns include the Singleton pattern, the Factory method pattern, and the Abstract factory pattern.\\n\\nStructural patterns: These patterns are used 